WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.292
Have you seen this map of all

00:00:01.292 --> 00:00:01.751
the coups

00:00:01.751 --> 00:00:03.294
happening in Africa lately?

00:00:03.294 --> 00:00:04.212
A coup is where someone,

00:00:04.212 --> 00:00:05.296
usually the military,

00:00:05.296 --> 00:00:06.256
illegally overthrows

00:00:06.256 --> 00:00:06.756
the government

00:00:06.756 --> 00:00:07.966
and just takes over.

00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:08.967
And here in central Africa,

00:00:08.967 --> 00:00:09.843
there have been 11

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:11.803
coup attempts since 2020.

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:12.595
Almost all of them

00:00:12.595 --> 00:00:13.722
have been successful,

00:00:13.722 --> 00:00:14.347
including this one

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:15.598
that just happened in Gabon.

00:00:15.598 --> 00:00:15.849
U.N.

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:17.517
secretary general is calling this

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:19.102
an epidemic of coups.

00:00:19.102 --> 00:00:19.394
And that's

00:00:19.394 --> 00:00:20.562
because when one military

00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:21.646
successfully overthrows

00:00:21.646 --> 00:00:22.355
their government

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:23.189
and the international community

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:24.274
doesn't really do anything,

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:24.983
there's sort of a

00:00:24.983 --> 00:00:26.443
contagious effect.

00:00:26.443 --> 00:00:27.360
Where would be coup

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:28.695
plotters in nearby countries

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:29.571
feel emboldened

00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:30.655
to do the same thing.

00:00:30.655 --> 00:00:31.072
The reason why

00:00:31.072 --> 00:00:31.823
all of this is happening

00:00:31.823 --> 00:00:34.284
now is because of a real contagion

00:00:34.284 --> 00:00:35.493
called COVID-19,

00:00:35.493 --> 00:00:37.078
which really ruptured

00:00:37.078 --> 00:00:38.413
these fragile economies,

00:00:38.413 --> 00:00:39.581
leading to higher prices,

00:00:39.581 --> 00:00:40.707
dissatisfied people,

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:41.458
and creating

00:00:41.458 --> 00:00:42.292
the perfect conditions

00:00:42.292 --> 00:00:43.460
for the military to come in

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:44.669
and overthrow the government.

00:00:44.669 --> 00:00:46.004
All of this marks a sharp decline

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:47.297
for democracy in this region.

00:00:47.297 --> 00:00:48.423
If you want to better understand

00:00:48.423 --> 00:00:49.632
international politics,

00:00:49.632 --> 00:00:50.633
follow for more.

